# Tech stack

Source of truth: [docs/tech-stack.md](../../docs/tech-stack.md)

- Node.js 22 LTS, TypeScript 5.x, ESM only.
- HTTP framework: Hono + `@hono/node-server`.
- MCP SDK: `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` (TypeScript). Streamable HTTP first.
- Google: `googleapis` + `google-auth-library`; Drive API v3.
- Sessions/storage: `ioredis` against Redis (Memorystore in prod) or Durable Objects on Workers; in-memory map for dev only.
- Logging: `pino` JSON to stdout with redaction. Optional Sentry via `SENTRY_DSN`.
- Testing: Vitest for unit/contract/integration; MCP Inspector for connector validation. No Playwright/UI tooling in v1.
- Lint/format: ESLint + Prettier + vibecop; CI enforces all three.
- CI/CD: GitHub Actions (`pr-validation.yml`, `ci.yml`, `release.yml`, `security.yml`); Cloud Run is the default target via Workload Identity Federation.
- Plugin: file-only bundle (`.claude-plugin/plugin.json`, `.mcp.json`, skills, optional commands, README).
